  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Onion bombs are a bold, flavor-packed recipe that turns simple onions into a sizzling, crowd-pleasing dish. Whole onions are peeled and stuffed with seasoned ground beef, herbs, and cheese, then wrapped in smoky bacon for the ultimate comfort bite. As they roast or grill, the onions caramelize while the bacon crisps, locking in juicy flavor that bursts with every forkful. Perfect for backyard barbecues, game day feasts, or a fun twist on dinner, onion bombs are as playful as they are hearty. With just a few ingredients, you’ll have a recipe that wows guests and makes weeknight meals feel unforgettable.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-onion-bombs\">Why You’ll Love This Onion Bombs</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-onion-bombs\">How to Make Onion Bombs</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-onion-bombs\">Pro Tips for Making Onion Bombs</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-onion-bombs\">How to Serve this Onion Bombs</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-onion-bombs\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Onion Bombs</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Juicy, flavorful bites that explode with taste.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to customize with your favorite seasonings.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for grilling or baking, making them versatile.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>A fun and impressive dish to share with friends.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for meal prep; enjoy them throughout the week!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-4404\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"4404\" d